cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "MoVoC: Morphology-Aware Subword Construction for Ge'ez Script Languages"
abstract: >-
  Morphology-aware subword vocabulary construction for Ge'ez-script languages
  (Amharic, Tigrinya, Tigre, Ge'ez), combining supervised morphological analysis
  with a constrained-merge BPE (MoVoC-Tok) whose merges may not cross morpheme
  boundaries.
type: software
license: MIT
